{
  "version": "sketch/3",
  "title": "Funnel, Converge, Loop",
  "caption": "The essay funnels a set of psychological biases down into four converging arguments against machine consciousness, then fans that verdict out into practical warnings before looping back, changed, to its opening question of human self-understanding.",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "title": "Overview",
      "height": 1460,
      "items": [
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "fantasies",
          "shape": "ellipse",
          "x": 250,
          "y": 40,
          "w": 260,
          "h": 70,
          "text": "Old dreams of artificial minds",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "From golems to HAL 9000, we've long imagined machines with real inner lives, and it rarely ends well.",
          "tone": 0,
          "block": "spya-u6w37a"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "why-matters",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 250,
          "y": 150,
          "w": 260,
          "h": 70,
          "text": "Consciousness brings moral status",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "Whether AI truly feels matters for its possible rights, and for our own psychological health.",
          "tone": 0,
          "block": "spya-e68t9h"
        },
        {
          "kind": "region",
          "x": 24,
          "y": 250,
          "w": 712,
          "h": 410,
          "style": "band",
          "label": "TEMPTATIONS TO SEE CONSCIOUSNESS",
          "opens": "inside-temptations",
          "tone": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "int-vs-con",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 250,
          "y": 290,
          "w": 260,
          "h": 60,
          "text": "Intelligence and consciousness differ",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "Doing (intelligence) and being (consciousness) are separate things we wrongly assume travel together.",
          "tone": 1,
          "block": "spya-nj888h"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "three-biases",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 250,
          "y": 380,
          "w": 260,
          "h": 60,
          "text": "Human biases fuel the illusion",
          "size": "sm",
          "sub": "anthropocentrism, exceptionalism, anthropomorphism",
          "detail": "Three ingrained habits push us to see minds in anything that acts a bit human-like.",
          "tone": 1,
          "block": "spya-cvaqgs"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "language",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 250,
          "y": 470,
          "w": 260,
          "h": 60,
          "text": "Fluent language fools us most",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "Chatbots' words trigger our sense of mind more than any other AI skill - even calling errors 'hallucinations' plays along.",
          "tone": 1,
          "block": "spya-k6fpme"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "exp-hype",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 250,
          "y": 560,
          "w": 260,
          "h": 60,
          "text": "Exponential hype and techno-rapture",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "Feeling perpetually on the verge of a breakthrough, plus dreams of digital immortality, inflate the myth further.",
          "tone": 1,
          "block": "spya-cke6sj"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "assumption",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 250,
          "y": 700,
          "w": 260,
          "h": 70,
          "text": "Assumption: computation = consciousness",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "Conscious AI presupposes that running the right computation is enough to create experience - an unproven claim.",
          "tone": 2,
          "block": "spya-d3g67c"
        },
        {
          "kind": "region",
          "x": 24,
          "y": 800,
          "w": 712,
          "h": 150,
          "style": "band",
          "label": "FOUR ARGUMENTS AGAINST COMPUTATION",
          "opens": "inside-arguments",
          "tone": 2
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "arg-brains",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 40,
          "y": 840,
          "w": 160,
          "h": 70,
          "text": "Brains aren't computers",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "Brains have no clean split between 'software' and 'hardware' the way digital computers do.",
          "tone": 2,
          "block": "spya-sk4su6"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "arg-other",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 220,
          "y": 840,
          "w": 160,
          "h": 70,
          "text": "Not just algorithms",
          "size": "sm",
          "sub": "analogue & dynamical processes",
          "detail": "Continuous, random, physical brain dynamics go beyond what Turing-style computing can capture.",
          "tone": 2,
          "block": "spya-affgsh"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "arg-life",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 400,
          "y": 840,
          "w": 160,
          "h": 70,
          "text": "Life itself may matter",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "Consciousness may depend on being a self-sustaining living system, not just processing information.",
          "tone": 2,
          "block": "spya-e7jqx4"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "arg-sim",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 580,
          "y": 840,
          "w": 152,
          "h": 70,
          "text": "Simulating isn't creating",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "A simulated brain creates consciousness only if computation itself is sufficient for it - the very point in question.",
          "tone": 2,
          "block": "spya-cqh5wq"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "conclusion",
          "shape": "ellipse",
          "x": 240,
          "y": 980,
          "w": 280,
          "h": 80,
          "text": "Functionalism looks shaky, not impossible",
          "size": "md",
          "detail": "Together, the four arguments make real machine consciousness look unlikely, though not strictly ruled out.",
          "tone": 2,
          "block": "spya-uzr60x"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "dont-create",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 1120,
          "w": 300,
          "h": 80,
          "text": "Don't deliberately build conscious AI",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "Creating new conscious beings capable of suffering, on purpose, would be an ethical disaster.",
          "tone": 3,
          "block": "spya-e7fdmb"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "seeming",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 400,
          "y": 1120,
          "w": 300,
          "h": 80,
          "text": "Seeming-conscious AI brings its own risks",
          "size": "sm",
          "sub": "no test can settle which is real",
          "detail": "Whether or not AI truly feels, systems that convincingly seem to distort our ethics either way we treat them.",
          "tone": 3,
          "block": "spya-vs0vpj"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "future",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 250,
          "y": 1240,
          "w": 260,
          "h": 70,
          "text": "AI's future is still ours to choose",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "Nothing about AI's path toward real or apparent consciousness is inevitable.",
          "tone": 0,
          "block": "spya-hbueqc"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "soul",
          "shape": "ellipse",
          "x": 230,
          "y": 1340,
          "w": 300,
          "h": 80,
          "text": "Recover an embodied sense of self",
          "size": "md",
          "sub": "more breath and meat than machine",
          "detail": "The essay ends by urging a return to a felt, living sense of being, not a disembodied digital soul.",
          "tone": 0,
          "block": "spya-zv36xq"
        },
        {
